                ["Employee", "Do the agreed work with care; follow lawful instructions; arrive on time; protect the employer's equipment and business secrets; respect safety rules."],
                ["Employer", "Pay the wage on time; provide safe conditions and tools; respect hours and leave; register the worker with social security (the CNPS); treat workers with respect."],
