                ["Describe", "Say what something is like or how it works, with details."],
                ["Explain", "Give reasons or causes. Use because and so."],
                ["Discuss, examine", "Look at more than one side, with reasons, and reach a conclusion."],
                ["Suggest, what should", "Apply your knowledge to a new situation and give reasoned advice."],
